<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">2 Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wa Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wa</para>
  <para style="mt">Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu eli Simɔ̃-Piɛɛl, ngɔmɔ̃ onse antam a Yeso Mãsia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Ndɛ áli mwɛn a oswɛɛl b'eswɛɛl Yeso emfa bvool áyoo nkii yi éfi ywel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:16-18">1.16-18</ref></char>). Ndɛ ayeel baal ndiri Yeso álieel tsɔɔn ndiri akieel abam ndɛ wu Piɛɛl me ndɔɔ a Yeso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:14">1.14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:18-19">Dzã 21.18-19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Piɛɛl k'abɛɛl b'eyuɔɔl ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wɛ, k'abɛɛl hɛ̃ mboo yi eyi ndɛ wɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Piɛɛl áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ŋ'eyii ndɛ sua epfu. Ke ngwel wɛ, ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ ŋã ãli m'ɔ̃lɛɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:12-15">1.12-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse sɔɔ li mbuaal, ndɛ olieel ndiri atee ba mfya àyeya. Bɔ akieel akie k'atsal ɔ̃sal a Mfam, obobɔ ndɛ owi b'eswɛn ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan ãnkunkwa kwɛn bɔ abee atee obɔ mpwee yi apfuru bɔ owa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Piɛɛl owi otsɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ ndiri: «byɛ ekal ãlio mbueel ye mpwee yi ebeyeel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃.» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:15">1.15</ref></char>). Ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kwel yi eyeel ndɛ etal otaa-taa bo Nsia yi ngesɛ, b'ofi ol'amwɛn, yi mbuaal etal ãyɛɛn m'ãfi ola Nziã m'ewi Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:16-21">1.16-21</ref></char>). Sɔɔ li mbuaal olɔ lueel eyɛɛn kɛn a me ndɔɔ a k'akal y'onkyab ke nkwel ãtee m'ayiool ba mfya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ke sɔɔ li ãtyel, Piɛɛl ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ oya o Mfam y'etumbu ki ekieel ebɔɔ atee ba mfya obɔ me lio olɔ. Kɛn a ndɛ ayeel ndiri Nziã «oli y'osɛ-mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'adzii kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ adziɔɔn wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ odzii kwɛn bueel akaal ɛ̃kwal» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">3.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Piɛɛl oman ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ m'owa b'ãnkunkwa me b'abeswɛɛl otsɛn o m'áswɛn onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:16">3.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Simɔ̃-Piɛɛl, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia bvool ndi ntam a ndɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola byɛ b'ebɔɔ okiool bo bvɛɛ emfa ngemɔ̃ ye bee, me nkuul a ãndɔɔ mã dzu mã Yeso Mãsia, wu oli Nziã bvool oli Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn nyiĩ y'opi ekal bam ngamfɛn ye byɛ m'oyɛɛ o Nziã ye Yeso wu Mfam a bia-byɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osa o mpɛn me ndɔɔ yi akal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Me waan e ndɛ li onziã, Mfam owi bia-byɛ kab li bvieel bvi eli bia-byɛ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ me ndɔɔ elaã y'okuru o nzuru me Nziã. Ndɛ osi kwɛn bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wu áti bia-byɛ mbel me lweel e ndyam ye waan e ndyam. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Me nkuul a lweel ye waan olɔ, Nziã áwi bia-byɛ ãlɔɔ m'ãnduru okuun bvool m'ãnduru ɔ̃bvɛn, kwɛn me nkuul a mɔ̃, byɛ ekal m'emfa ki Nziã, bvool epal onse obii b'oli onse ɔ̃kiri, b'ofa m'efua bvi ebi-ebi. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />M'otsɛn obɔ bam, esa mpɛn yam me ndɔɔ yɛn ke ywel okiool o byɛ, byɛ ekool epfuũ bvi ngesɛ bvool nkal epfuũ bvi ngesɛ, byɛ ekool oyɛɛ o Nziã. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Nkal oyɛɛ o Nziã, ekool okuru b'ɔ̃kwal, nkal okuru b'ɔ̃kwal, ekool osɛ-mwiĩ, bvool nkal osɛ-mwiĩ, ekool okuru o nzuru me Nziã. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Bvool nkal okuru o nzuru me Nziã, ekool ondoo bo ngwanyã, bvool nkal ondoo bo ngwanyã, ekool dzii. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn epfuũ bvi ebvɛ bvi eli onse byɛ bvool okɛɛn bvɛ ebelweel nzuru lio lueel onse byɛ, bvɛ k'esuul byɛ baal b'ali y'obwal wɛ, bvɛ hɛ̃ k'esuul byɛ eywɛn a esia wɛ. Kɛn a bvɛ esa kwɛn byɛ ekal onse oyɛɛ o Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Kɛn a mbuul wu oywɛn epfuũ obvɛ oli ɔ̃nkwa-mviil, bvool k'amwɛn kal-a-kal wɛ. Ndɛ abedzɛɛn kwɛn ámaasuɔɔl ndɛ m'ãbi ã ndɛ m'ãtsɔɔn. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, andoo a dzii, esa mpɛn bvool bibi me ndɔɔ yi ekuru nzuru me mbel yi éti Nziã byɛ bvool m'osuaal b'ésueel ndɛ byɛ. Byɛ esa obobɔ, byɛ k'èbva bam onse obi wɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />M'emfa okyɛ, àdzweel byɛ bam edzoo bvi Okwɛn b'ɔ̃bu bo Mfam y'Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãtee m'ãyi nkuul mɔ̃ y'otaa-taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ èyeel byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ kɛn oyeel, onkyam ŋɛn byɛ emeeyɛɛ mɔ̃ bvool ekuru nzuru onse otaa-taa b'ásuo byɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Mɛ̃ etsam wɛn eli dzu kwɛn mɛ̃ ebeseel byɛ, ŋ'ebeyeel mɛ̃ byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, me lio kɛn li ndi mɛ̃ m'ɔ̃kiri wu. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, lio li embal mɛ̃ ɔ̃kiri wu eyii tsotsoo, onge b'émeeyɛɛl Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia mɛ̃ yɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Mɛ̃ esa mpɛn kwɛn onkyam ke mbee a ke mbal mɛ̃ ɔ̃kiri wu, byɛ ekal ãlio mbueel ye mpwee yi ebeyeel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">B'ámwɛn lweel e Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ke yam, ŋ'elieel bee byɛ m'oya bo ye waan bo Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, bee k'eti byɛ esesam bvi aburu m'oburu y'ãyal mbueel wɛ. Kɛn a bee elieel yɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bee eli baal b'ámwɛn okuun o ndɛ me mviil ã bee-myam. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã wu Taal áwi ndɛ lweel y'omfam me lio lɛn onse lweel e ndɛ li enɛn, nkii a ndɛ élieel ndɛ bubu: «Wu bu Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, me ndɛ, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ bibi.» <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Bee myam bam éyoo nkii yi éfi ywel oyɔ, ŋ'éli bee ye ndɛ nkal a nkio yi ngel. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bee ekiool bam wɛn nsia yi élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã eli yi taa-taa. Byɛ esi ngesɛ ŋ'ekuru byɛ nzuru m'ãndɔɔ mɔ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɔ̃ ãli onge mbunda wu anywɛɛn onse mboo yi eli ye lempeel tiil ye k'eyɔɔl bviil bvool ye k'eyɛɛl ngam-a-ngam wu epal-epal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, eyɛɛ bubu: K'eli ye mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ wɛ, wɛn m'ãyal ã ndyam, okoo k'abɛɛl ãyɛɛn m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã m'ãli onse Ɔ̃nkaan. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, lɔɔ-okal, ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã si ngɔmɔ̃ wu ámaayɛɛn m'ãtsam ã ndyam k'ali wɛ. Kɛn Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensaal wu ási kwɛn baal ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ã́fi ola Nziã.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ayiool ba mfya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Kɛn a tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn ba mfya áli onse yam li Isalayel. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, onse byɛ, ayiool ba mfya akieel apal. Bɔ akieel alɔ ãtee m'ãdzeel baal onse byɛ m'ãyal, bvool abee Ɔ̃tee wu ásuun bɔ. Bɔ akieel asa kwɛn odziɔɔn b'enseel oya nkal a bam. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Baal bibi akieel anɔɔn a bɔ onse ãndɔɔ ã bɔ m'opfuru, bvool me ndɔɔ a bɔ, akieel asiaan nkuul yi otaa-taa. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Me ndɔɔ a nzal a nzi yi eli a bɔ, bɔ akieel apfuru byɛ m'esesam bvi eburu bɔ m'oburu. Kɛn etel-nziil, etumbu e bɔ ámaayɛɛl, bvool odziɔɔn o bɔ k'òbeyiil wɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'ákwɛɛn k'awa ãnzwel m'ã́si obi etumbu wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ átyel mɔ̃ onse ywɛn e mbaa. Oyɔ mboo yi ákwee mɔ̃ m'okuru onse lempeel, me ndɔɔ a tsoo li akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ k'ákwɛɛn k'awa ɔ̃kiri wa tsɔɔn etumbu wɛ, kɛn a ŋ'éyuɔɔl ndɛ mpel yi nɛn onse ɔ̃kiri ondɛ wɛn baal k'ákelweel ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ ábvuul kɛn a Nowa ye baal nsiaan akyam. Ndɛ wu Nowa wu áketee ãndɔɔ mã dzu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:4">Obɛ 6.1–7.4</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Nziã hɛ̃ áwi bviil li Sodom ye li Gomɔɔl etumbu me mbaa yi ékaal mɔ̃ lefuru. M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ ŋ'ásuul mɔ̃ ndɔɔ yi esuo baal b'abesa ãbi ndɔɔ yi ekieel eya<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Obɛ 19.24</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Kɛn ndɛ ábvuul Lot, wu mbuul wa dzu wu áyoo ãwua bibi me ndɔɔ epfuũ bvi opfuru bvi baal b'edzyal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-16">Obɛ 19.1-16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wa dzu wu ákekal onse bɔ, tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, ákeyoo mpal onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ wa dzu, me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi m'ékemwɛn ndɛ bvool m'ékeyoo ndɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Obobɔ, Mfam oyɛɛ emfa ki abvuul baal b'akuru nzuru me ndɛ onse ɔ̃mbio, bvool oyɛɛ k'asuul b'asa ãbi me pyɛ me ndɔɔ yi awa bɔ etumbu me tsoo li àtsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Ndɛ bvel-bvel awa etumbu me baal b'abenɔɔn efua e bam bvi ebi-ebi bvool abesiaan omfam o Nziã. Ayiool ba mfya obɔ ali ye nzal a nsia y'ondɛɛl o dzuru bvool k'abebal k'atoo eluɔ e lweel bvi ke ywel wɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Onkyam ãnzwel m'ãli ye mpɛn ye waan bibi, mɔ̃ k'ãbefɛn eluɔ e lweel obvɛ wɛ, k'ãbetoo bvɛ hɛ̃ ke nkwel a Mfam wɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Kɛn a baal obɔ ali onge anyam bɛn ãyal pyɛ, b'ábuo me ndɔɔ yi abekwɔɔl m'abɛɛ bvool me ndɔɔ yi abebam. Bɔ abetoo bvɛn bɔ k'ayɛɛ wɛ, obobɔ bɔ àkwa onge anyam. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Bɔ àbɔɔ obi onge furu li obi b'ési bɔ. Bɔ ayoo esɛ m'osa b'ãndɔɔ m'etam efua e nzuru, mwiĩ lɛ. Bɔ asa ãndɔɔ mã mbiin ye m'opfuru. Ŋ'ebebɛɛl bɔ ãpfuun ye byɛ, bɔ abeyoo esɛ ki apfuru byɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Mviil ã bɔ ãluul m'esio bvool bɔ k'abeyool m'osa b'obi wɛ. Bɔ abedzuru baal b'eli okiool nkuaal-a-nkuaal. Ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃luul m'ɔ̃tam, bɔ baan b'ápuul ali. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bɔ amaasiil nkuul yi dzu, amaatwal wuaan, ŋ'enɔɔn a bɔ nkuul yiyi onge Balam wu muaan a Bosɔɔl. Balam wu ádzii furu li ebi-ebi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Kɛn a ndɛ ábɔɔ mbyel me ndɔɔ obi o ndyam. Ke ngwel wɛ, ane, wu nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri ãpfuũ wɛn k'ali y'ɔ̃nywa wu ayɛɛn wɛ, áyɛɛn me nkii yi mbuul, bu atɛɛl owool b'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn Balam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Ɛ̃bv 22.4-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Ayiool ba mfya obɔ ali onge ɛ̃tswɛ mi amvieel mi ɛ̃ywɛn a ãdza bvool onge epɛn bvɛn mfel a mpuru abetsɛɛn. Ákwee bɔ mboo onse lempeel li tsia. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Bɔ abeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ondɛɛl o nzuru bvool mɛn otsɛn pyɛ. Bɔ abewal efua e nzuru onge elii ki edzuru baal b'apal alili oŋɔ̃ onse nkel a adzɛɛn. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Atee obɔ abeliaal baal obɔ ndiri bɔ apaal bɔ onse onkyal, ŋ'asa kwɛn bam ali ankyal b'efua bvi ebiri bam k'obii. Ke ngwel wɛ, eluɔ enyam mbuul, ndɛ oyii ɔ̃nkyal a kyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ke mbee a ŋ'epal bɔ onse ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi m'ɔ̃kiri me nkuul yi oyɛɛ o Mfam y'Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, bɔ bvool ayɔɔl ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbiri bɔ bvool ãnyam bɔ. Fool e bɔ li alili enduru li tsɔɔn. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ngesɛ bɔ akaabee nkuul yi dzu oyɛɛ, ye kwɛn bɔ ayɛɛ yɔ bvool ayiri ngel yi ɔ̃nsensal yi áwi bɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Mboo élieel taa-taa me ndɔɔ a bɔ ndiri: «Mva okɔɔl k'eloo e ndyam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Ãmb 26.11</ref></char></note>», bvool ndiri: «Nguru wu afi osuɔɔl, okɔɔl oyekeel nzuru onse tɔɔl.»<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Oya o Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃ b'adzii, wu eyii ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wu nswɛn mɛ̃ byɛ. Onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃nge-bviaal, mɛ̃ ngyeel byɛ ãndɔɔ me ndɔɔ yi eseel emfa ki ngesɛ ki atsam. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ eyeel ãyɛɛn m'élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ba ngel tsɔɔn. Eyeel hɛ̃ ãngel m'éyiool antam byɛ, mɔ̃ ãli ãngel ã ndɛ wu oli Mfam bvool oli Ɔ̃mvuul. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ŋ'ɛkwel kɛn, eyɛɛ wɛn m'ãtsoo ã ntɔ, anga-sɔɔl akieel aya, bɔ akieel adzuul m'emfa ki efua e bam bvi ebi-ebi. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Bɔ akieel aliaal ndiri: «Ndɛ áwi lɔɔ ndiri ndɛ àya, ke ndɛ a ndɛ ŋã? Bɛɛn mwɛn ékwi ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ, ãndɔɔ mbueel ãli kɛn emfa kiki onge k'obɛɛn b'ɔ̃kiri!» <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn bɔ obobɔ, bɔ awuo osa ŋ'ebedzɛɛn bɔ ndɔɔ yi: Etel-nziil, Nziã ábuo ywel ye nsie m'Endɔɔ e ndɛ. Ndɛ opaal nsie onse ãdza bvool obuo yɔ m'ãdza. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />M'ãdza hɛ̃, Nziã bvool ádziil ɔ̃kiri wa tsɔɔn, ɔ̃kiri ondɛ bu akwi. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Me b'otal ywel li lio li ye nsie yi lio li, Endɔɔ e Nziã lili esuul eluɔ obvɛ m'okwɛɛ me ndɔɔ yi edzioo bvɛ mbaa. Akwee bvɛ me ndɔɔ a tsoo li àtsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal, li abam anga-ãbi. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Kɛn andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, eli ye ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yɛn byɛ k'ebvaan edzɛɛn wɛ: ola Mfam tsoo ngelemɔ̃ eli onge amvel miil (1.000), bvool amvel miil ali onge tsoo ngelemɔ̃. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Mfam k'ayiil m'osa o ndɔɔ yi éwi ndɛ lɔɔ wɛ, onge b'ebetsam baal bakyɛ. Ndɛ oli y'osɛ-mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'adzii kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ adziɔɔn wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ odzii kwɛn baal bueel akaal ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Kɛn a tsoo e Mfam èyeya onge b'eya mbuul a pfuul. Me tsoo olɔ, ywel ekieel ebwel ye nkyal bibi. Eluɔ bvi ke ywel ekieel edzio mbaa. Bvool nsie ekieel edzio mbaa ye bvieel bvi eli me yɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Onge bɛn bvieel ekieel edziɔɔn, eyɛɛ emfa kyɛn ebvaan byɛ ekal: Ebvaan byɛ edzuu m'emfa ki baal ba ngel bvool ekuru nzuru me Nziã. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Byɛ ebekiaal kwɛn tsoo e Nziã eya, bvool byɛ edzii kwɛn lɔ eya tswa-a-tswa. Me tsoo olɔ, mbaa ekieel edziool ywel, bvool eluɔ bvi ke ywel ekieel esuul. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Kɛn a ki ebekiaal bia-byɛ, m'emfa e lɔɔ li éwi Nziã, eli ywel li alili ye nsie yi alili, okɔ ekieel ekal y'ãndɔɔ mã dzu.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Obobɔ, andoo a dzii, ŋ'ebekiaal bia-byɛ tsoo olɔ, esa mpɛn yam me ndɔɔ yi ekal tsɛtsɛ bvool elyal pyɛ ke mviil ã Nziã, bvool me ndɔɔ yi ekal onse opi ye ndɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Eyɛɛ bam wɛn, osɛ-mwiĩ o Mfam a bia-byɛ owa byɛ mpwee yi ebvuul. Pool wu ndoo a bia-byɛ wa dzii ákel obobɔ, m'emfa ki ãyal m'éwi Nziã ndɛ. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Onse ɛ̃nkaan mvieel mi ebeyɛɛn ndɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ, ndɛ abeswɛn obobɔ. Onse myɛ̃, eli y'ãmbel mã ye mpal m'okwaal b'otsɛn, mɛn baal b'onse edzɛɛn bvool bɛn k'áyiool bɔ ngesɛ wɛ, abeswɛɛl mɔ̃ otsɛn. Bɔ hɛ̃ abesa obobɔ onse ãmboo mãkyɛ m'Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã. Ŋ'ebesa bɔ obobɔ, bɔ ŋ'abebiil elaã e bam. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Andoo a dzii, onge bɛn amaawa byɛ ãnkunkwa, oŋɔ̃ ekal y'onkyab, kwɛn byɛ ebee baal bɛn k'alweel Nziã wɛ onɔɔn, bvool kwɛn bɔ abee byɛ ombaal onse emfa ki esɛn byɛ ãnã. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Kɛn ekwel onse nyiĩ y'oyɛɛ o Mfam y'Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. Yɔɔl kwɛn lweel ekal li ndɛ meba ŋã y'ɔ̃bu nzal ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>